   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Pupa of leek moth or onion leaf miner (Acrolepiopsis assectella) family Acrolepiidae. It is Invasive speciesa pest of leek crops. Larvae feed on Allium plants by mining into the leaves or bulbs.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
